sequenceDiagram
accTitle: RPO is data age, RTO is recovery duration
accDescr: A snapshot reaches the recovery Region before the outage. Recovery creates a cluster and cuts clients over within the tested budget.
participant Primary as Primary Region
participant DR as Recovery Region
participant Ops as Recovery automation
participant Client as Clients
Primary->>DR: Completed snapshot copy
Note over Primary,DR: Recoverable snapshot age at failure must be under 24 hours
Note over Primary: Region outage begins
Ops->>DR: Restore copied snapshot
DR-->>Ops: New cluster ready for validation
Ops->>Client: Update endpoint and verify service
Note over Ops,Client: Tested restore + validation + cutover = 40 minutes
